\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Come, Holy Ghost, our hearts inspire, 
\par Let  us Thine influence prove,
\par Source of the old prophetic fire,
\par Fountain of light and love.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Come, Holy Ghost, for moved by Thee
\par The prophets wrote and spoke;
\par Unlock the truth, Thyself the key,
\par Unseal the sacred Book.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Expand Thy wings, celestial Dove,
\par Brood o'er our nature's night;
\par On our disordered spirits move,
\par And let there now be light.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. God, through Himself, we then shall know,
\par If Thou within us shine,
\par And sound, with all Thy saints below,
\par The depths of love divine.
\par                                   Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

